Goldberg's, I did it for 10 years, Mean Girls, the first movie, the new Mean Girls, and then school, the spinoff from Goldberg's, I played the principal.
在《戈德堡一家》里演了10年，第一部《贱女孩》，新版《贱女孩》，然后是《戈德堡一家》的衍生剧《校舍风云》，我演的是校长。

295
00:14:38.840 --> 00:14:45.280
And now I'm in a new movie called Dream Scenario with Nicolas Cage, and I play a dean of the college.
现在我在一部叫《梦景巴黎》的新电影里和尼古拉斯·凯奇合作，我演的是大学院长。

296
00:14:45.640 --> 00:14:47.920
You were meant to be in education.
你就是注定要从事教育行业的。

297
00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:54.820
Creative people only see me as, you know, as their teacher or something.
有创意的人只把我当成，你知道的，当成他们的老师或者别的什么。

298
00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:55.980
It's crazy.
太疯狂了。

299
00:14:56.500 --> 00:15:00.680
Do you remember your character's occupation on the pilot we did, the Gabriels?
你还记得我们在我们拍的试播集《加布里埃尔一家》里你角色的职业吗？

300
00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:02.580
Were you a teacher?
你是个老师吗？

301
00:15:03.220 --> 00:15:04.740
He may have been a teacher.
他以前可能当过老师。

302
00:15:04.860 --> 00:15:05.400
I think you were.
我觉得你确实是。

303
00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:09.740
As you were saying that, I was like, wait, I think he was a teacher.
你刚才这么说的时候，我在想，等等，我觉得他确实是个老师。

304
00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:11.800
I think he was a teacher.
我觉得他就是个老师。

305
00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:12.760
Oh, my gosh.
哦，天哪。

306
00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:16.900
And I even told my agent and manager at one point, I was like, I can't do any more teaching.
我甚至一度对我的经纪人和经理说，我再也不能演老师了。

307
00:15:16.900 --> 00:15:24.920
Because I kept getting other requests for roles, even just in episodic things, you know, where it was like, yeah, he's the principal of the, you know,
因为我不断接到其他角色的邀约，哪怕只是电视剧里的客串，你知道的，那种角色就是，没错，他是那个什么，校长，你知道的，

308
00:15:25.340 --> 00:15:26.940
there's a meeting with him in the PTA.
就是家长会上有他开会的场景。

309
00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:28.020
I'm like,
我就想，

310
00:15:28.140 --> 00:15:38.420
I can't keep doing this because people are going to think it's kind of like connection between the things that I've other shows that I've done or that I'm not very versatile,
我不能再这样下去了，因为人们会觉得这和我的过往作品、我演过的其他剧集之间有什么联系，或者会觉得我的戏路不够宽，

311
00:15:38.740 --> 00:15:39.040
you know?
你知道吗？

312
00:15:40.220 --> 00:15:43.720
So either way, no more fucking principles after Dream Scenario.
所以不管怎样，《梦景巴黎》之后再也不接他妈的校长了。

313
00:15:43.780 --> 00:15:44.560
It ends here.
到此为止。

314
00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:45.540
This is it.
就是这样。

315
00:15:45.620 --> 00:15:45.840
That's it.
就这样吧。

316
00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:49.060
2024 is the end of the principal roles.
2024年是校长角色的终结。

317
00:15:49.980 --> 00:15:51.800
Don't call Tim Meadows.
别找蒂姆·麦道斯了。

318
00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:53.060
You heard it here.
你们就在这儿听到的。

319
00:15:53.320 --> 00:15:53.780
Anymore.
再也不演了。

320
00:15:54.440 --> 00:15:55.380
For teacher roles.
再也不演老师的角色了。

321
00:15:55.620 --> 00:15:55.880
I don't play tutors.
我不演家教。

322
00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:57.360
I don't play teachers.
我不演老师。

323
00:15:57.720 --> 00:15:58.920
I don't play instructors.
我不演教练。

324
00:15:59.620 --> 00:16:02.560
Nothing where I'm giving information to people.
任何需要我向别人输出信息的角色都不演。

325
00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:10.140
So we should share with people that this version of Mean Girls has some musical numbers.
所以我们应该告诉大家，这个版本的《贱女孩》包含一些音乐歌舞片段。

326
00:16:10.380 --> 00:16:12.400
Do you sing or dance in the movie?
你在电影里唱歌还是跳舞？

327
00:16:12.440 --> 00:16:13.240
Because I don't.
因为我没有。

328
00:16:13.240 --> 00:16:17.680
Oh, I was hoping you did because I would love to see that.
哦，我本来希望你有的，因为我很想看看那样的场景。

329
00:16:17.880 --> 00:16:20.080
She would have loved to dance.
她本来会很乐意跳舞的。

330
00:16:20.420 --> 00:16:21.300
She tap dances.
她会踢踏舞。

331
00:16:21.600 --> 00:16:24.060
I can't believe you don't tap dance in this movie, Jenna.
詹娜，我真不敢相信你在这部电影里不跳踢踏舞。

332
00:16:24.300 --> 00:16:24.900
I tried.
我试过了。

333
00:16:24.900 --> 00:16:28.200
When I was on set, I pulled the choreographer aside.
当我在片场时，我把编舞叫到了一边。

334
00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:29.700
We did tap dancing.
我们排了踢踏舞。

335
00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:35.520
I thought maybe I could, I don't know, maybe Miss Heron has a tap number.
我当时想，也许我能，我不知道，也许海伦老师有一段踢踏舞呢。

336
00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:36.280
It didn't happen.
但没能实现。

337
00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:38.900
The sound guy hated that moment, too.
收音师当时也讨厌那个时刻。

338
00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:42.960
He's like, what's all that noise over there?
他说，那边到底是什么噪声？

339
00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:46.200
Jenna Fisher tap dancing by Crab Services.
詹娜·费舍在螃蟹服务公司旁边跳踢踏舞。

340
00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:48.620
Again, here she goes.
又来了，她又开始了。

341
00:16:49.040 --> 00:16:50.560
Actually, I do sing.
其实，我确实唱歌。

342
00:16:50.900 --> 00:16:51.400
You do?
是吗？

343
00:16:52.040 --> 00:16:52.800
I do, yes.
是的，我会唱。

344
00:16:52.800 --> 00:16:54.080
Oh, that's so exciting.
哦，太令人兴奋了。

345
00:16:54.480 --> 00:16:58.620
You know, we only had one day where we overlapped filming on this movie.
你知道，这部电影拍摄期间，我们的档期只有一天重合。

346
00:16:58.980 --> 00:16:59.500
Yes.
是的。

347
00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:01.940
And I didn't see you sing that day.
那天我没看到你唱歌。

348
00:17:01.940 --> 00:17:04.280
But, oh, I'm very excited to see this now.
不过，哦，我现在非常期待看到这个。

349
00:17:05.060 --> 00:17:05.500
Yeah.
对。

350
00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:13.160
I actually, they had me come in and redo it recently because, obviously, when I did it live, I was flat or something.
其实，他们最近让我去重新录了一遍，因为很显然，我当时现场唱的时候音准偏低还是怎么的。

351
00:17:14.140 --> 00:17:16.280
I don't know what they call it, flat or sharp.
我不知道他们叫它什么，降音还是升音。

352
00:17:16.440 --> 00:17:17.460
I was one of those things.
我就是其中之一。

353
00:17:19.120 --> 00:17:24.080
So, I came in and they were, like, doing that thing of, like, hit it with this note here.
所以，我走进去，他们当时就在那儿，像是，用这个音符来敲击。

354
00:17:24.280 --> 00:17:25.200
Here is your note.
这是你的音符。

355
00:17:25.420 --> 00:17:25.600
I'm up here.
我在上面。

356
00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:26.440
Yes.
对。

357
00:17:26.660 --> 00:17:27.640
You're down here.
你在下面。

358
00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:28.920
You're down here.
你在下面。

359
00:17:29.640 --> 00:17:33.240
Well, Tim, you know, we were in Walk Hard together, too.
蒂姆，你知道的，我们以前也一起拍过《永不退缩》。

360
00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:34.740
Yes, my favorite.
对，我最喜欢的。

361
00:17:35.100 --> 00:17:36.080
Let me tell you something.
我跟你说个事。

362
00:17:36.300 --> 00:17:36.560
Yes.
对。

363
00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:38.820
That is the most quoted movie to me.
那是人们对我说得最多台词的电影。

364
00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:40.740
It's an amazing movie.
那是一部了不起的电影。

365
00:17:41.020 --> 00:17:45.120
It is one of my, maybe my favorite movie I've ever been in.
它是我演过的电影里，可能是我最喜欢的一部。

366
00:17:45.260 --> 00:17:47.120
I haven't seen Mean Girls yet, okay?
我还没看过《贱女孩》，好吗？

367
00:17:47.400 --> 00:17:52.160
So, but I absolutely loved Making Walk Hard and I love the movie.
所以，但我绝对喜欢拍《永不退缩》的过程，我也很喜欢这部电影。

368
00:17:52.360 --> 00:17:53.520
We had so much fun.
我们玩得太开心了。

369
00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:55.120
We had so much fun.
我们玩得太开心了。

370
00:17:55.120 --> 00:17:56.760
What's the quote you get from that movie?
你从那部电影里听到最多的台词是什么？

371
00:17:57.260 --> 00:18:00.660
For me, it's, you don't want no part of this.
对我来说，是，你可沾不上这玩意儿。

372
00:18:01.060 --> 00:18:01.540
The dress.
裙子。

373
00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:02.700
You want no part of this.
你可沾不上这玩意儿。

374
00:18:03.240 --> 00:18:03.540
Yeah.
是啊。

375
00:18:03.800 --> 00:18:08.460
And then the weed, whole weed run of all the drug runs, people will say to me, you know,
然后是大麻，整个大麻毒品交易环节，人们会跟我说，你知道的，

376
00:18:08.660 --> 00:18:09.980
it's not habit forming.
它不会让人上瘾。

377
00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:11.740
I think I want to try it.
我想我得试试。

378
00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:14.020
You don't want no part of this, Dewey.
你可沾不上这玩意儿，杜伊。

379
00:18:14.640 --> 00:18:17.080
It takes all of your bad feelings to make them good.
它能把你所有的坏心情都变成好心情。

380
00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:19.520
Well, I do really want to try.
好吧，我真的很想试试。

381
00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:21.120
You don't want no part of this, Dewey.
你可沾不上这玩意儿，杜伊。

382
00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:23.980
I get that a lot.
我经常听到这句话。

383
00:18:24.140 --> 00:18:25.000
People love it.
人们太喜欢它了。

384
00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:28.760
And the thing is that musicians also are big fans of that movie.
关键是，音乐人也是那部电影的超级粉丝。

385
00:18:28.760 --> 00:18:35.320
I've had numerous musicians tell me that they just keep it on a loop on their tour buses and they quote it.
有很多音乐人告诉我，他们把这部电影在巡演大巴上循环播放，而且还会背台词。

386
00:18:35.320 --> 00:18:40.500
That movie, I always tell people, was the most fun of all the things I've done.
我总是告诉别人，那部电影是我做过的所有事情里最有趣的。

387
00:18:40.780 --> 00:18:45.360
That movie was 30 days, whatever, of just, like, we had fun.
那部电影拍了30天左右，总之就是，我们玩得很开心。

388
00:18:45.760 --> 00:18:46.680
Laughed so hard.
笑得肚子疼。

389
00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:48.740
Chris Parnell and Matt Besser.
克里斯·帕内尔和马特·贝瑟。

390
00:18:48.740 --> 00:18:49.460
Oh, my gosh.
哦，天哪。

391
00:18:49.540 --> 00:18:50.180
Chris Parnell.
克里斯·帕内尔。

392
00:18:50.180 --> 00:18:50.680
With those guys, too.
还有那些家伙。

393
00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:55.540
And I had known Matt Besser forever and had never really hung out with him that much.
我和马特·贝瑟认识很久了，但以前其实没有怎么一起玩过。

394
00:18:55.600 --> 00:18:57.160
And then we became really good friends.
然后我们成了很好的朋友。

395
00:18:57.400 --> 00:19:00.780
Even now, we're, like, way closer than we've ever been.
甚至现在，我们比以前任何时候都要亲密。

396
