And then the director, Jake Kasdan, came up to me a few weeks later and he was like,
然后导演杰克·卡斯丹几周后走到我面前，对我说，

423
00:19:49.260 --> 00:19:49.760
you know what, Jenna?
你知道吗，珍娜？

424
00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:52.260
You're a fantastic actress.
你是一位出色的演员。

425
00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:53.200
Uh-oh.
噢哦。

426
00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:55.320
And you're so funny in the film.
你在电影里太搞笑了。

427
00:19:55.840 --> 00:20:01.320
But we're going to go ahead and just replace your voice with the woman who did the practice
但我们还是决定直接用唱小样示范的那位女士的声音来替换你的声音。

428
00:20:01.320 --> 00:20:01.860
track.
小样。

429
00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:07.380
But great, great effort.
不过干得好，真的很努力。

430
00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:10.860
We're still going to use your face.
我们还是会用你的脸。

431
00:20:11.120 --> 00:20:11.480
Yeah.
对。

432
00:20:11.720 --> 00:20:12.340
Don't get me wrong now.
别误会我的意思。

433
