00:20:21.340 --> 00:20:23.760
And that's why Miss Aaron doesn't sing.
这就是艾伦小姐不唱歌的原因。

436
00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:24.480
I don't know.
我不知道。

437
00:20:25.540 --> 00:20:28.440
It was the most awkward conversation.
那是最尴尬的对话。

438
00:20:29.000 --> 00:20:30.780
Oh, that's so funny.
哦，太搞笑了。

439
00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:37.300
Jake was sleeping in his bed one day and it was like, hello, hi, Mean Girls people.
有一天杰克正睡在床上，就好像是，喂，你好，《贱女孩》剧组的人。

440
00:20:37.300 --> 00:20:39.060
Why didn't you tell us?
你们为什么不告诉我？

441
00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:41.860
She's terrible.
她太差劲了。

442
00:20:42.500 --> 00:20:42.980
She's horrible.
她太糟糕了。

443
00:20:42.980 --> 00:20:46.740
I am in a couple of musical numbers in Mean Girls, which was-
我在《贱女孩》里有几场音乐歌舞戏，那是——

444
00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:47.260
In the real one.
在真正的电影里。

445
00:20:47.420 --> 00:20:47.660
Yeah.
对。

446
