I'm very excited about it because, you know, they're all dancing or singing around me.
我对此非常兴奋，因为你知道，他们都在我身边载歌载舞。

447
00:20:53.380 --> 00:20:55.280
So I got to observe it.
所以我得以在一旁观察。

448
00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:57.420
And they're like, stay out of this.
他们就说，别掺和这个。

449
00:20:57.720 --> 00:21:00.040
They're like, just stand there.
他们就说，站在那儿就行。

