00:21:10.820 --> 00:21:11.440
Amazing.
太棒了。

455
00:21:11.860 --> 00:21:12.940
Here's my moment.
我的高光时刻到了。

456
00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:17.140
I had to sing Little Drummer Boy in front of the whole bullpen of the office.
我不得不在办公室整个大办公室的人面前唱《小鼓手男孩》。

457
00:21:17.260 --> 00:21:18.360
I remember that.
我记得那个。

458
00:21:18.360 --> 00:21:22.600
And Harold Ramis was directing, and I kept losing the tune.
而且是哈罗德·雷米斯导演的，我一直走音。

