00:21:23.640 --> 00:21:27.640
He came up and he was like, it's Little Drummer Boy.
他走过来对我说，这可是《小鼓手男孩》啊。

460
00:21:29.020 --> 00:21:30.080
You know what I mean?
你知道我的意思吗？

461
00:21:30.280 --> 00:21:33.200
Like, he didn't say it.
就是，他没明说。

462
00:21:33.240 --> 00:21:38.040
He was so kind, but he implied, like, how can you lose the beat on Little Drummer Boy?
他人很好，但他的潜台词是，你怎么能连《小鼓手男孩》的拍子都能找不着呢？

463
00:21:38.720 --> 00:21:40.340
Ba-ra-ba-ba-ba.
哒-拉-哒-哒-哒。

464
00:21:40.560 --> 00:21:41.020
That's it.
就是这样。

465
00:21:41.020 --> 00:21:41.800
What else you looking for?
你还想找什么？

466
00:21:41.800 --> 00:21:42.300
That's it.
就是这样。

467
00:21:42.460 --> 00:21:45.220
But I told him, I was like, Harold, I can't do this.
但我跟他说，哈罗德，我做不到。

468
00:21:45.220 --> 00:21:45.860
I can't sing.
我不会唱歌。

469
00:21:45.920 --> 00:21:46.940
And he's like, but you will.
他说，但你必须做到。

470
00:21:47.440 --> 00:21:48.760
And I was like, oh, Lord.
我说，噢，天哪。

471
00:21:48.800 --> 00:21:50.780
The syncopation is in the lyrics, okay?
切分音都在歌词里，好吗？

472
00:21:50.960 --> 00:21:51.640
Do you understand?
你明白吗？

473
00:21:51.880 --> 00:21:54.540
The syncopation is in the lyrics.
切分音就在歌词里。

474
00:21:55.520 --> 00:21:56.220
I know.
我知道。

475
00:21:56.220 --> 00:21:57.780
It was, like, so embarrassing.
真是太尴尬了。

476
00:21:58.520 --> 00:22:01.340
You guys, should the three of us do a musical?
伙计们，我们三个要不要搞个音乐剧？

477
00:22:01.360 --> 00:22:01.660
A musical?
音乐剧？

478
00:22:02.520 --> 00:22:03.660
The three of us?
我们三个？

479
00:22:04.120 --> 00:22:05.900
Like, Tim, you will shine.
蒂姆，你会大放异彩的。

480
00:22:06.100 --> 00:22:07.120
You will shine.
你会大放异彩的。

481
00:22:07.340 --> 00:22:10.040
In our three-person musical, you will be the star.
在我们这个三人音乐剧里，你将是主角。

482
00:22:10.040 --> 00:22:10.560
I would stand out.
我会脱颖而出的。

483
00:22:10.560 --> 00:22:11.100
You will.
你会的。

484
00:22:11.200 --> 00:22:12.600
I would stand out, finally.
我终于能脱颖而出了。

485
00:22:12.980 --> 00:22:14.460
It will be sh**tastic.
那绝对会烂透了。

486
00:22:14.560 --> 00:22:21.220
Unfortunately, though, I started kind of pitching on it, and you will need to play a teacher.
不过可惜的是，我刚才已经开始构思了，你得演一个老师。

487
00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:21.800
A teacher.
一个老师。

488
00:22:23.620 --> 00:22:25.100
It's an eighth-grade teacher.
是个八年级老师。

489
00:22:25.540 --> 00:22:28.880
Well, if I can sing and play a teacher, forget it.
好吧，如果我能唱歌还能演老师，那算了。

490
00:22:29.100 --> 00:22:29.600
I'm in.
我加入。

491
00:22:30.200 --> 00:22:30.400
Okay.
好的。

492
00:22:30.560 --> 00:22:32.800
Because we mentioned there's not a lot of money, but.
因为我们提过没多少钱，但是。

493
00:22:34.480 --> 00:22:35.660
It doesn't matter.
没关系。

494
00:22:35.880 --> 00:22:37.020
It doesn't matter for the art.
为了艺术，没关系。

495
00:22:37.160 --> 00:22:37.520
It doesn't matter.
没关系。

496
00:22:37.940 --> 00:22:38.060
Yeah.
对。

497
00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:41.040
This was so fun.
这太有趣了。

498
00:22:41.340 --> 00:22:41.940
Thank you so much.
非常感谢。

499
00:22:41.940 --> 00:22:42.440
You guys killed me.
你们把我笑死了。

500
00:22:43.380 --> 00:22:45.400
Thanks for coming on Office, ladies.
谢谢你们来参加《办公室女士》播客。

501
00:22:45.620 --> 00:22:46.020
Yeah.
是啊。

502
00:22:46.360 --> 00:22:47.280
Oh, it's my pleasure.
哦，这是我的荣幸。

503
00:22:47.520 --> 00:22:49.780
Well, you know, I listened to the show, obviously.
嗯，你知道的，我当然听过这个节目。

504
00:22:50.080 --> 00:22:53.500
