你把我弄哭了。

552
00:24:50.380 --> 00:24:51.440
I'm crying over here.
我都快哭了。

553
00:24:53.420 --> 00:24:54.820
Thank you for having me.
谢谢你们邀请我。

554
00:24:55.100 --> 00:24:56.420
Yes, absolutely.
对，绝对的。

555
00:25:07.660 --> 00:25:08.700
We are back.
我们回来了。

556
00:25:08.840 --> 00:25:09.700
My heart is full.
我的内心充满了感动。

557
00:25:09.920 --> 00:25:11.260
Tim is so wonderful.
蒂姆太棒了。

558
00:25:11.580 --> 00:25:12.240
I love him.
我太喜欢他了。

559
00:25:12.440 --> 00:25:13.100
What a treat.
真是个好东西。

560
00:25:13.780 --> 00:25:18.720
All right, before we get into this episode, I feel like we need a little call sheet tidbit.
好了，在我们深入探讨这集之前，我觉得我们需要一点通告单的花絮。

561
00:25:19.300 --> 00:25:19.720
Already?
这么快？

562
00:25:19.980 --> 00:25:21.620
Already from Steve Burgess.
来自史蒂夫·伯吉斯的爆料。

563
00:25:21.620 --> 00:25:22.980
I got all the call sheets.
我拿到了所有的通告单。

564
00:25:23.220 --> 00:25:25.380
And I have to share this just right away.
我得马上分享这个。

565
00:25:25.820 --> 00:25:30.040
Y'all, it was the week of August 6th when we shot this episode.
大家听着，我们拍这集的时候正是8月6日那一周。

566
00:25:30.700 --> 00:25:34.180
Monday, the first day of filming, was the coolest day of the week.
星期一，也就是拍摄的第一天，是一周里最凉爽的一天。

567
00:25:34.380 --> 00:25:35.820
It was 98 degrees.
气温是98华氏度。

568
00:25:36.300 --> 00:25:36.780
Wow.
哇。

569
00:25:37.160 --> 00:25:39.280
We're getting to triple digits real faSt.
我们很快就要突破三位数了。

570
00:25:39.660 --> 00:25:40.000
Yeah.
是啊。

571
00:25:40.240 --> 00:25:46.220
This was a hot week, and this is going to come up later when I discuss some location challenges
这一周真热，等我后面讨论因这炎热天气带来的一些外景挑战时

572
00:25:46.820 --> 00:25:48.240
based on this heat.
你们就会知道了。

573
00:25:48.780 --> 00:25:50.700
Well, let's get into this cold open.
好了，我们来聊聊这个冷开场。

574
00:25:50.920 --> 00:25:52.800
It's a personal favorite of mine.
这是我的个人最爱。

575
00:25:53.020 --> 00:25:54.420
It's the chore wheel.
就是家务轮盘。

576
00:25:54.880 --> 00:25:57.340
Jenna, have you made a chore wheel in your real life?
珍娜，你在现实生活中做过家务轮盘吗？

577
00:25:57.640 --> 00:25:58.120
No.
没有。

578
00:25:58.280 --> 00:25:59.440
