你肯定以为我做过。

579
00:25:59.620 --> 00:26:00.300
Chore chart?
家务表？

580
00:26:00.560 --> 00:26:01.280
Chore anything?
任何跟家务相关的？

581
00:26:01.600 --> 00:26:02.160
Chore lists?
家务清单？

582
00:26:02.300 --> 00:26:03.240
I bet there's chore lists.
我敢说肯定有家务清单。

583
00:26:03.520 --> 00:26:04.940
Yeah, we have a whiteboard.
对，我们有一个白板。

584
00:26:05.400 --> 00:26:05.720
Okay.
好吧。

585
00:26:05.820 --> 00:26:06.440
Right?
对吧？

586
00:26:06.640 --> 00:26:07.220
That counts.
那也算。

587
00:26:07.560 --> 00:26:08.580
That's a chore board?
那是家务板？

588
00:26:08.720 --> 00:26:09.500
Chore board.
家务板。

589
00:26:09.620 --> 00:26:09.920
Okay.
好吧。

590
00:26:10.280 --> 00:26:12.620
I really regret not keeping the chore wheel.
我真的很后悔没把那个家务轮盘留下来。

591
00:26:12.780 --> 00:26:13.460
Oh, that would have been a good one.
哦，那个绝对是个好收藏。

592
00:26:13.460 --> 00:26:14.360
Any of the chore wheels.
任何一个家务轮盘都行。

593
00:26:14.580 --> 00:26:14.740
Yeah.
对啊。

594
00:26:14.840 --> 00:26:15.660
I wanted the mini wheel.
我想要那个小轮盘。

595
00:26:15.660 --> 00:26:16.860
I wanted the bigger wheels.
我也想要那些大轮盘。

596
00:26:17.780 --> 00:26:20.040
I begged Phil Shea for them.
我求了菲尔·谢伊好久。

597
00:26:20.280 --> 00:26:23.740
But there were not multiples of these chore wheels.
但这些家务轮盘没有备份。

598
00:26:24.360 --> 00:26:30.760
There was one of each, and he had to put them in storage in case we ever use them again
每种只有一个，他必须把它们存进仓库，以防以后在节目中

599
00:26:30.760 --> 00:26:31.400
on the show.
还会用到。

600
00:26:31.560 --> 00:26:34.300
You know, there's a possibility the chore wheel could come back.
你知道的，家务轮盘还是有可能回归的。

601
00:26:34.500 --> 00:26:34.580
It could.
有可能。

602
00:26:34.680 --> 00:26:35.440
It could have been a thing.
本来是可以有的。

603
00:26:35.660 --> 00:26:35.820
Yeah.
是啊。

604
00:26:35.940 --> 00:26:36.940
So I couldn't take it.
所以我没办法拿。

605
00:26:37.000 --> 00:26:39.520
And I just wish I would have remembered when the show was over.
而且我真希望节目结束的时候我想起来了。

606
00:26:39.760 --> 00:26:41.180
That's what I'm kicking myself about.
这正是我现在懊恼的地方。

607
00:26:41.180 --> 00:26:44.660
Yeah, the mini chore wheel, like sitting on a bookshelf, would be amazing.
对啊，那个迷你值日转盘放在书架上，肯定超棒的。

608
00:26:44.820 --> 00:26:44.980
Right?
对吧？

609
00:26:45.180 --> 00:26:49.700
I did see online this young gal at college made herself a mini chore wheel.
我确实在网上看到有个大学女生给自己做了个迷你值日转盘。

610
00:26:49.940 --> 00:26:50.420
Aw.
噢。

