而且根本没人打扫。

619
00:27:12.500 --> 00:27:14.440
So Pam makes her chore wheel.
于是帕姆就做了个值日转盘。

620
00:27:14.640 --> 00:27:15.200
Yes.
没错。

621
00:27:15.440 --> 00:27:17.620
But nobody likes it because it doesn't spin.
但大家都不喜欢，因为它转不起来。

622
00:27:18.140 --> 00:27:21.260
I would like to point out that Pam has fancy nail polish again.
我想指出的是，帕姆又涂了好看的指甲油。

623
00:27:21.640 --> 00:27:22.200
Yes.
是的。

624
00:27:22.200 --> 00:27:24.000
This time it's a burgundy color.
这次是酒红色的。

625
00:27:24.160 --> 00:27:24.520
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

626
00:27:25.040 --> 00:27:30.200
Also at 16 seconds, I really enjoyed the detail that Dwight is sitting at his desk and
另外在16秒处，我特别喜欢一个细节，就是德怀特坐在自己的办公桌前

627
00:27:30.200 --> 00:27:32.160
not participating in the conference room meeting.
